This licence covers D2Map's own code, tools and textures.

D2Map/Data/MinimapTiles.lua is generated from OpenMap's tile table
(https://github.com/openmap-world/openmap), which is MIT licensed, Copyright (c)
2026 OpenMap contributors. Its licence notice is reproduced at the top of that
file.

The minimap tiles the addon displays are Blizzard Entertainment's own art. They
are loaded from the game client and are not included here. World of Warcraft is
a trademark of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. D2Map is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Blizzard Entertainment.
